                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Report by the Deputies</hi></p>
                <p>The Deputies’ Report on the Agenda of the Council’s proceedings (C.F.M.(46) 116) was adopted.<anchor n="42"
                        xml:id="d179-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Reparation from Italy</hi></p>
                <p>Views were exchanged on the question of the reparation to be made by Italy.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>The Council agreed to hold its next meeting at 3 p.m. on Wednesday, 19th June,
                    1946.</p>
